        "text": "=Below is the text of a clinical genetic test report.\n\nFind the variant table and return ONE LINE PER VARIANT, in exactly this pipe-separated format, and nothing else:\n\ngene|hgvs_c|hgvs_p|zygosity|lab_classification|genome_build\n\nRules:\n- Copy values exactly as printed. Do not correct or reformat them.\n- If a field is not printed, write NONE.\n- If the report states a reference build such as GRCh38 or hg19, put it in genome_build; otherwise write NONE.\n- If you cannot find a variant table, return exactly: NO_VARIANTS_FOUND\n- Never invent a variant. Add no commentary, heading or explanation.\n\nREPORT TEXT:\n{{ $json.text }}",
